## Skip known-missing `_props` and optimize expansion SQL

Context: Explorer expansion on a Lakehouse graph built before the property
companion was introduced paid a failing `_props` query on every request. Live
measurements also showed Spark depth-zero expansion taking 10.85 seconds
because it joined the payload relation through generic BFS CTEs. A graph-index
refresh plus the optimized SQL reduced depth 0 / 1 / 2 medians to 1.48 / 1.83 /
1.69 seconds, approximately 86% / 69% / 42% faster.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/props.py
   Added a process-local negative property-companion cache and shared
   execute-with-fallback helper.
2. src/back/core/graphdb/adjacency.py
   Added direct subject filtering for depth zero and a Spark broadcast hint
   for the bounded entity payload join.
3. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaFlatStore.py
   Reused the shared fallback helper and invalidated stale negatives after a
   successful graph-index rebuild.
4. src/back/core/graphdb/lakebase/LakebaseFlatStore.py
   Applied the same fallback and invalidation lifecycle to Lakebase.
5. tests/units/graphdb/test_props_sql.py
   Covered negative-cache, fallback, and unrelated-error behavior.
6. tests/units/graphdb/test_adjacency_sql.py
   Covered depth-zero SQL and backend-specific broadcast hints.
7. tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_flat_store.py
   Covered repeated missing companions and rebuild invalidation for Delta.
8. tests/units/graphdb/test_lakebase_adjacency.py
   Covered repeated missing companions and rebuild invalidation for Lakebase.
9. docs/optimizations.md
   Documented the fallback lifecycle and before/after live timings.
10. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-16-expansion-fallback-latency-design.md
    Recorded the evidence, decisions, boundaries, and success criteria.
11. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-16-expansion-fallback-latency.md
    Added the TDD implementation and verification plan.
12. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-15-search-transversal-next.md
    Corrected shipped Preview optimization status and linked the measured
    expansion follow-up.

